        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LEONARD WILSON KEENAN ESTATE & LETTING AGENTS \r\nOur business is you….\r\n\r\n4 BED / 2 BATH TERRACED HOME WITH LARGE ATTIC CONVERSION\r\nMOST SOUGHT AFTER GATED DEVELOPMENT OF HOMES \r\nIDYLLIC POSITION WITH WEST FACING BACK GARDEN\r\nADJACENT TO THE NEW CHILDRENS HOSPITAL \r\n\r\nLeonard Wilson Keenan The Dublin 8 Property Specialists are truly delighted to present this excellent property to the Dublin 8 property market. \r\n\r\nModern homes in this area are rare to come to market and number 38 would make an excellent family home or lucrative investment.\r\n\r\nThe well laid out accommodation consists of: Entrance hall, living room, kitchen / dining room and utility room.\r\n\r\nUpstairs there is a landing, 4 bedroom & 2 bathrooms.\r\n\r\nThe property further boasts a large attic room.\r\n\r\nThis is a most strategic location with a LUAS stop within close proximity. Grafton Street, Hueston Station and Temple Bar are all within close proximity. The Phoenix Park is also on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nThe many features of this lovely home include:\r\nQuality flooring throughout, feature fireplace in living room, fitted kitchen with an abundance of base and eye level storage to include all appliances & white sanitary ware and tiling in both bathrooms.\r\n\r\nThe property further boasts double glazed windows.\r\n\r\nThe property is in a great catchment of both primary and secondary schools making it a real winner with families.\r\n\r\nThe M50 and M4 Motorways are also close by making this a most strategic location with the city on your doorstep together with all arterial routes within close proximity.\r\n\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
